00:06:59.432 --> 00:07:02.944
Right, you know, the ear
is the key in this scenario

00:07:02.944 --> 00:07:04.941
because the truth is,
the way to push somebody

00:07:04.941 --> 00:07:07.690
above their limit is to
actually have individual

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.587
conversations with them

00:07:09.587 --> 00:07:12.815
