what she wants out of it,

00:07:31.651 --> 00:07:34.661
professionally, and
knowing that I'm the person

00:07:34.661 --> 00:07:36.400
that can most likely make that happen,

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:38.340
at least in the context of this world,

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:40.405
that just even having the conversation

00:07:40.405 --> 00:07:42.061
puts her in better spot.

00:07:42.846 --> 00:07:47.046
But some people are literally
rawly driven by straight cash.

00:07:47.046 --> 00:07:49.384
Like, truly, you wanna push somebody?

00:07:49.384 --> 00:07:52.231
You carrot, like, "Hey,
