00:07:54.057 --> 00:07:55.888
You know, and so, you've gotta find out

00:07:55.888 --> 00:07:57.033
what makes people tick.

00:07:57.033 --> 00:07:59.728
I'm so not motivated by cash,

00:07:59.728 --> 00:08:02.238
that so many people try
to get me to do things,

00:08:02.238 --> 00:08:04.970
JV with me, invest in things,

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:07.381
do things, speak at things.

00:08:07.381 --> 00:08:09.561
And they think cash is the way to do it.

00:08:09.561 --> 00:08:11.957
And, listen, I love the cash,

00:08:11.957 --> 00:08:13.311
but it's not my biggest driver.

00:08:13.311 --> 00:08:15.969
And I make a lot of
decisions based on legacy,

00:08:15.969 --> 00:08:18.236
long-term impact, on myself by the way.

00:08:18.236 --> 00:08:20.717
Not like long-term global impact.

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.654
You know, that's not how I think.

00:08:23.654 --> 00:08:25.296
I mean, I think there's
a byproduct of that

00:08:25.296 --> 00:08:27.244
but that's not the
number one thing for me.

00:08:27.244 --> 00:08:31.221
But, to answer the
question in a general-form,

00:08:31.221 --> 00:08:35.226
I truly do believe the best
way to get that is to guilt.

00:08:35.226 --> 00:08:37.600
And what I mean by guilt,
it's a variation of listening.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:41.092
Which is not only listening,
but delivering in a world

00:08:41.092 --> 00:08:43.373
where so few people even begin to listen,

00:08:43.373 --> 00:08:45.653
let alone delivering on that listening.

00:08:45.653 --> 00:08:48.769
And once you start doing
that, people start realizing,

00:08:48.769 --> 00:08:49.926
let me tell you what's
happening at Vayner;

00:08:49.926 --> 00:08:51.102
it's not super confusing.

00:08:51.102 --> 00:08:52.959
I know exactly what's
goin' on in this company.

00:08:52.959 --> 00:08:54.914
