point to Phil Toronto,

00:09:00.803 --> 00:09:02.654
or to somebody else and
be like, "Wait a minute."

00:09:02.654 --> 00:09:06.142
Or Steve Unwin, like, you
can start pointing to,

00:09:06.142 --> 00:09:08.028
"Oh, crap, that person wanted that,

00:09:08.028 --> 00:09:09.045
"that person's getting that,

00:09:09.045 --> 00:09:11.041
"that person's happy as crap!"

00:09:11.041 --> 00:09:14.045
