00:09:14.045 --> 00:09:16.873
and then delivering, which
then creates a scenario

00:09:16.873 --> 00:09:19.934
where people want to over-deliver because,

00:09:19.934 --> 00:09:23.146
the only way somebody
will over-deliver for you,

00:09:23.146 --> 00:09:24.635
'cause you asked a very selfish question.

00:09:24.635 --> 00:09:27.519
"How can I get my team
to over-deliver for me?"

00:09:27.519 --> 00:09:28.679
